      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "T-S J1.4, v, right [Col. IV]",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>b. [Sh]ekhanya 6 the wife of \u02bfAw\u0101\u1e0d 5</li>\n<li>Moshe the Kohen 2 the Kohen from Sudan 5</li>\n<li>the orphans of Yosef 8 the wife of the silk worker 4</li>\n<li>\u1e62adaqa and transport 11 [[Wah\u012bb]] al-Kal\u0101siyya 3</li>\n<li>the acquaintance of Azhar 8 the acquaintance of the man from Damietta 6</li>\n<li>\u1e62adaqa \u1e62adaqa</li>\n<li>the daughter of al-Thulayth 2 the sister of Yi\u1e63\u1e25aq 2</li>\n<li>the daughter of al-Jady 2 the house of Sa\u02bfada 4</li>\n<li>\u00a0b. al-Murahhi\u1e6d (son of the writer/singer of liturgical poetry) and the stricken man 8 b. Yi\u1e25ye 4</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b Kath\u012br 4 Umm Ibrahim 2</li>\n<li>the divorc\u00e9 of the producer/seller of fine things 2 the wife of Ma\u02bfl\u0101\u02be and her in-law 10</li>\n<li>the wife of Wah\u012bb 3 Ab\u016b Hil\u0101l 5</li>\n<li>the wife of \u1e24ur\u0101ra 3 the blind woman 8</li>\n<li>the wife of al-\u02bfAn\u0101n\u012b 4 the mother of the orphan girl 4</li>\n<li>Lubuwwa 4 a woman from Palestine 3</li>\n<li>the producer/seller of fine things and his mother-in-law 6 b. Naf\u012b\u02bf and his sister 10</li>\n<li>b. al-Qu\u1e0d\u0101\u02bf\u012b (healer of stomach ailments) 6 Sim\u1e25a 4 [[3]]</li>\n<li>al-Mak\u1e25l\u016bl 4 Na\u02bf\u012bm 4</li>\n<li>\u1e24asan the glassmaker 3 the deaf man 8</li>\n<li>Sab\u012b\u02bf the blind man 5 the in-law of Yosef 6</li>\n<li>Shim\u02bfon 4 the man from Acre 6</li>\n<li>\u02bfAyy\u0101sh 4 Ya\u02bfaqov the blind man 3</li>\n<li>the wife of the furrier 5 Umm \u02bfUbayd 3</li>\n<li>Avraham of Tiberias and his in-law 6 Ab\u016b Shaykha 2</li>\n<li>Ma\u02bf\u0101l\u012b 3 Umm Ka\u1e25l\u0101\u02be</li>\n<li>b. Ab\u016b\u02bel-\u1e24ayy 10 Moshe the preparer of litharge 10</li>\n<li>for expenses 10\u00a0 8</li>\n<li>251</li></ol>\n",
