          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "T-S J1.4, v, left [Col. III]",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;The R\u016bm</li>\n<li>Eliyyahu 2 an orphan 1 Mub\u0101raka 2 Sitt\u0101n 2</li>\n<li>Za\u02bffar\u0101n 6 Umm al-Khayy\u0101t (the mother of the tailor) 1 the female proselyte (<i>al-gera</i>) 2</li>\n<li>Shemarya 4 the mother-in-law of Eliyyahu 2 the female washer of the dead 2</li>\n<li>an orphan 1 Mordekhay the blind man 3 a semi-paralyzed woman 2</li>\n<li>Ya\u02bfaqov 1 D\u012bn\u012b 2 the orphan of the Karaite <del>1</del> 2</li>\n<li>the son of the Kohen 3 the old person 3 Umm Matatya 2</li>\n<li>Rivqa 2 Mal\u012b\u1e25a 2 Umm \u02bfAynayn \u1e24amd 3</li>\n<li>the wife of Eliyyahu 2 Eliyyahu 2 Eliakim 1</li>\n<li>the wife of the deceased man 4 Kin\u0101na 1 Umm Y\u016bsuf 2</li>\n<li>Yehuda 2 an orphan 1 Moshe 1 a scribe 2</li>\n<li>the mother-in-law of the <i>parnas</i> of the R\u016bm 2 the female teacher 3</li>\n<li>an errand boy from R\u016bm 4 the wife of an elder from R\u016bm <del>79</del></li>\n<li>four from R\u016bm</li>\n<li>8&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;87</li>\n<li>the total: five hundred</li>\n<li>and three loaves</li></ol>\n",
